#. Tag: title
#: doccomments.docbook:11
#, no-c-format
msgid "Document Comments"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: primary
#: doccomments.docbook:12
#, no-c-format
msgid "comments"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: doccomments.docbook:14
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Document comments are included in &kword; to allow you to have your "
"documents read by another person. That person can make comments about the "
"text and the comment will appear right next to the text."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: doccomments.docbook:17
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding a comment to a document"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: doccomments.docbook:18
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To add a comment to a document, select the text you want the comment to "
"apply to."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: doccomments.docbook:19
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Select <menuchoice> <guimenu>Insert</guimenu> <guimenuitem>Comment...</"
"guimenuitem> </menuchoice> from the menubar. This will bring up a small "
"dialog box."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: doccomments.docbook:23
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Type the text of your comment in the dialog box provided. If you click on "
"the <guibutton>Add Author Name</guibutton>, the text will be signed, dated "
"and the current time will be added."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: doccomments.docbook:25
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The authors name must be entered in the <link linkend=\"documentinfo"
"\">Document Information</link> dialog or the name will not be included."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: doccomments.docbook:27
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"When you have entered all of your text, click <guibutton>OK</guibutton> to "
"add your comment."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: doccomments.docbook:28
#, no-c-format
msgid "The comment will appear as a small yellow box at the cursor location."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: doccomments.docbook:31
#, no-c-format
msgid "Adding to or changing the comment in a document"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: doccomments.docbook:32
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To add more comments or change previous comments place the mouse pointer "
"over the comment you want to edit. Click once with the &RMB;. A popup menu "
"will appear. Select <guilabel>Edit Comment...</guilabel>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: doccomments.docbook:34
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can now make your changes to the comment."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: doccomments.docbook:37
#, no-c-format
msgid "Deleting a comment from a document"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: doccomments.docbook:38
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To delete a comment, place the mouse pointer over the comment you want to "
"edit. Click once with the &RMB;. A popup menu will appear. Select "
"<guilabel>Remove Comment</guilabel>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: doccomments.docbook:40
#, no-c-format
msgid "The comment is immediately deleted."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: doccomments.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid "Hiding all comments in a document"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: doccomments.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To hide all comments, select <menuchoice> <guimenu>Settings</guimenu> "
"<guimenuitem>Configure &kword;...</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> from the "
"menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: doccomments.docbook:48
#, no-c-format
msgid "This will bring up a dialog box."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: doccomments.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid "Click on <guilabel>Misc</guilabel>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: doccomments.docbook:66
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The check box labeled <guilabel>Display comments</guilabel> is used to "
"toggle the comments on and off."
msgstr ""

